 "verdict_line": "NULL. An accepted IB break does not run to the close any more than the same clock time and direction on other days, a failed poke does not reverse more than that either, and neither flow (proxy) nor candle strength at the break changes it. 0 of 16 powered cells move; NQ and ES agree; YM and RTY replicate the nothing.",
